  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#shared-history-push/replace-state-steps\n\n> Let _document_ be _history_'s associated [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document).\n\nHistory objects don't have an associated Document. Should probably be:\n\n> Let _document_ be _history_'s [relevant global object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-relevant-global)'s [associated Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-window)\n\ncc @farre",
